          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;It is with great trepidation that Angella allows her daughter and her friends to rescue the former Horde commander from Beast Island. The very last thing that the Queen expects from this mission is for her family to double in size.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;or;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Set during exile; bits and pieces of Angella's perspective.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>aswellingstorm</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
      <dc:subject>
        <rdf:Bag>
          <rdf:li>Fanworks</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Not Rated</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>She-Ra and the Princesses of Power (2018)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora/Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Angella/Micah (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Angella &amp; Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra &amp; Micah (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Angella (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Micah (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Glimmer (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Bow (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Scorpia (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Perfuma (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra (She-Ra) Redemption</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra Needs Therapy (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra Leaves the Horde (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Fluff</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Family Bonding</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>there is SLIGHT angst but not much</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>this may be the least angst I've posted &amp;lt;3</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>essentially exile but from angellas POV</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>imagine being queen and your not-dead husband comes back</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>except he brought an angsty teen with him</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>and you already had ONE angsty teen</rdf:li>
